OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 24 NOV
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GKatie Derham talks to artist and
OL,6,     Gwriter Edmund de Waal about the
OL,7,     Gnew BBC Two documentary
OL,8,     GCivilisations: Rise and Fall.
OL,9,     GThere's live music from Anglo-
OL,10,     GIrish traditional band Flook.
OL,11,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,12,     GTo celebrate the return of
OL,13,     GCivilisations to BBC Two, take
OL,14,     Gtime out with a 30-minute
OL,15,     Gsoundscape of Rome-inspired
OL,16,     Gclassical music.
OL,17,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,18,     GRadio 3 New Generation Artists
OL,19,     Gthe Kleio Quartet are joined by
OL,20,     Gclarinettist Annelien van Wauwe,
OL,21,     Gflautist Elizaveta Ivanova and
OL,22,     Gharpist Sally Pryce.
